  "translation": "Ge sešo se phethilwe, Yisraele ka moka, bao ba hweditšwego ditoropong tša Yehuda, ba ile ba tšwa, ba thuba ⟨את⟩ dipilara, ba rema dikgopama tša Ashera, ba theola ⟨את⟩ mafelo a phahamo le ⟨את⟩ maletare — go tšwa Yehuda ka moka le Benjamine, gomme le Efraime le Manase, go fihla go phedišwa; morago ga moo bana ba Yisraele ka moka ba boetše, mongwe le mongwe go dithoto tša gagwe, ditoropong tša bona.",
